Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 23:09:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] test(v2,shared): fix pre-existing failures - spawn shim,
 audit allowlist, sqlite GC teardown, truncator env isolation

- serve-http: route lsof port probe through the sanctioned Bun spawn shim
  (fixes dist-bundle + adapter-runtime audits, raw Bun.spawn from 502a4f0fd)
- prompt-async-route-audit: allowlist 3 pre-existing lane prompt routes
- session-db.test: Bun.gc(true) before rm - bun:sqlite on Windows releases
  the file handle only on GC, close() alone leaves opencode.db locked
- dynamic-truncator tests: isolate ANTHROPIC_1M_CONTEXT/VERTEX_ env so a
  polluted process env cannot flip explicit-false test expectations

Monolithic proof: parent 44fe40175 = 8673p/7f, branch = 8679p/1f
(remaining failure is an order-dependent artifact, passes 9/9 isolated)

(cherry picked from commit f4b34d7be68cfa82e4750c41943ecf5f7221d873)
